! mcp_bootstrap_p297.strap -- MCP printed page 297: THE SPECIAL
! ASSIGNMENT PACKAGE (ZASN01 .. B,DMCP), lines 1-48.
!
! docs/MCP_Mar63_250-445.pdf PDF p.48, read at 400 dpi.  Header, READ:
! "TIME CLOCK 00054041  PUNID 11D11MCP  CARD ID QJ000001  DIST. OF 3/01
! 3/01  PAGE NUMBER 297" (round glyphs in numeric fields read 0).  The
! heading row's LOCATION field is BLANK.  CARD ID QJ000001 -- a new
! card-ID series begins on this page (p.281 ran QD...).
!
! THE PAGE.  48 lines, every line number prints a "*" after it.  Lines
! 1-4 are remark cards (a banner "THE SPECIAL ASSIGNMENT PACKAGE"
! between two rows of asterisks).  Line 5 "SLC,$" prints 232746.00 and
! a "*"; this deck restates it as a hard SLC (as p.261 does).  Lines 6-9
! remarks ("CALLING LINKAGE / SIC,ZCOM90  B,ZASN01  VF,IOD NUMBER").
! Line 18 is a remark.  Located rows run contiguous from 232746.00
! (line 10) to 233003.00 (line 48, B,DMCP, a half word; next location
! 233003.40), then blank paper.  "*" after the LOCATION on lines 5, 25
! and 40.
!
! JOIN.  p.296 has no scratch neighbour; contiguity with it is NOT
! established here.  This page's labels match the landed forward
! references: p.230/p.232 SIC,ZCOM90 -> 232762.00 and B,ZASN01 ->
! 232746.10 (here ZCOM90 at 232762.00 line 27, ZASN01 at 232746.00 line
! 10).  p.298 should open at 233003.40.
!
! GLYPHS SETTLED BY OTHER THAN PLAIN INK:
!   * "Z CCM 99" (line 10), "Z CCM C1" (line 11): the drum's open O;
!     written ZCOM99 / ZCOM01 -- lines 25-27 print "Z COM 95 / 98 / 90"
!     with closed O's, landed pp.230/232 spell ZCOM90, and C22-6728 names
!     the save subroutine ZCOM01.  The numbered family takes digit 0.
!   * "Z ASN 01", "ASN 04/06/07/09": digit 0 by the numbered family
!     (landed ZASN01, pp.230/232).
!   * CMOCOO / CMOCO0 (lines 22, 23, 31) = CM0000 (connective digits);
!     CT0C11 (lines 14, 44) = CT0011.
!   * lines 39, 41 "ST(DU,16,8)" / "ST(CU,8,8)": D with a worn stem; both
!     print 0x.24 in the second half (decimal-mode bit), so both DU.
!   * "S I MNT" (line 29) = SIMNT, "S UN A A" (line 20) = SUNAA, "S CH
!     AVL" = SCHAVL, "S UN AVL" = SUNAVL, "S CNF CG" = SCNFCG, "S FILE K"
!     = SFILEK, "S UNIT N" = SUNITN, "S RMTC" = SRMTC, "S DISPO" =
!     SDISPO, "D MCP" = DMCP: spaces are the drum's, spellings as landed.
!   * octal fields "CCCCCC.CC" read 0; hex "CO", "FO", "DO" = C0, F0, D0.
!   * the B rows' op byte (lines 11, 27, 48) prints "CC" / "C0" / "C0"
!     at 900 dpi, the first glyph as open as line 24's real C.  Written
!     00: B assembles byte 00 on all 319 landed B rows and never C0, and
!     line 11's "CC" shows this drum printing 0 open in both positions
!     (as p.230 line 44 "B,ZASN01 (byte prints C0)").
!
! EXTERNALS.  S-fields copy the defining decks' forms (p.99 / p.101 /
! p.103).  Z-addresses from this page's binary (see each comment).
!
! CARD SERIALS.  QJ000001 .. QJ000048, line N prints QJ0000NN; none
! skipped.

SCHAVL  SYN(BU,1), 0.25              ! p.99 line 21 -CHANNEL AVAILABILITY
SUNAVL  SYN(BU,1), 0.28              ! p.99 line 26 -UNIT AVAILABILITY
SUNASG  SYN(BU,1), 0.29              ! p.99 line 27 -UNIT ASSIGNMENT
SOWNER  SYN(BU,1), 0.32              ! p.99 line 30
SVER    SYN(BU,1), 0.40              ! p.99 line 32 -VERIFY FILE STATUS
SRD     SYN(BU,1), 0.57              ! p.99 line 45 -READ
SMOUNT  SYN(BU,1), 0.51              ! p.99 line 42 -MOUNT TAPE
SIMNT   SYN(BU,1), 0.53              ! p.99 line 44
SDISPO  SYN(BU,1), 0.27              ! p.99 line 25
STATI   SYN(BU,1), 0.26              ! p.99 line 23
SUNAA   SYN(BU,25), 0.0              ! p.99 line 19 -UNIT AREA TABLE FIELD
SFILEK  SYN(BU,12), 7.38             ! p.101 line 25 -FILE COUNT
SUNITN  SYN(BU,3), 0.47              ! p.101 line 6 -UNIT NUMBER
SRMTC   SYN(BU,26), 1.32             ! p.101 line 8 -REMINDER MESSAGE TIME
SCNFCG  SYN(BU,1), (8)215001.02      ! landed p.103 line 12 SYN(BU,1),SCOMRG+.2; CM1111 line 16 215001.02
SYSMOD  SYN(BU,2), (8)215001.10      ! landed p.103 line 18 SYN(BU,2),SCOMRG+.8; CT line 44 215001.10
DMCP    SYN, 32.0                    ! landed p.108; B line 48 000040.10
